{"code":"091970","name":"LSK아이로봇","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"화학","sector_desc":"석유화학·정밀화학·2차전지 소재 등. 유가, 중국 수요, 스프레드(제품가−원료가)가 실적을 좌우합니다.","desc":"동사는 1999년 설립된 ESD 소재 전문회사로, 2007년 코스닥 상장 후 중국, 베트남에 3개의 해외 제조 법인을 운영하고 있음. 유기전도성고분자, 이온콤플렉스 전도성고분자, 카본나노튜브 등 원료 개발·제조하여 도전성원료, 도전성플라스틱, 기능성 ESD보호필름을 주요 사업으로 하고 있음. 해외법인은 S사, L사, TCL 등 주요 IT업체에 판매하며, 나노실버 투명전극, 퀀텀닷 소재 등 신규 기술로 사업을 확장하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-30","n_days":300,"close":2840.0,"open":2800.0,"high":2930.0,"low":2800.0,"volume":4913,"amount":13952920.0,"ret_1d":-4.8576,"gap":-6.1977,"range_pct":4.5775,"ret_5":-5.1753,"ret_20":-17.6812,"ret_60":-32.8605,"ret_120":-24.967,"ret_250":-15.8519,"ma20":3269.0,"ma60":3727.5833,"ma120":3609.625,"ma200":3430.3,"close_vs_ma200":-17.2084,"close_vs_ma60":-23.8112,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-77.7102,"r2_60":0.81,"slope_120":4.0852,"r2_120":0.0014,"slope_250":12.7992,"r2_250":0.0625,"high52":5590.0,"low52":2335.0,"pos_52w":15.5146,"dd_52w":-49.195,"mdd_1y":-52.2863,"atr14_pct":9.2882,"vol_ann_60":43.6155,"vol_avg20":16489.4,"vol_ratio20":0.2979,"vr5":0.2116,"vr20":0.0704,"amount_avg5":21663435.0,"amount_avg20":53409976.75,"amount_avg60":103865539.1667,"obv_chg20":-49.5161,"turnover_20":4.3769,"pv_eff_20":-4.0397,"rsi14":31.2126,"frgn_net_5":-4006.0,"inst_net_5":-5.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0532,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0001,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0532,"frgn_net_20":11712.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.1554,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.1554,"frgn_net_60":5226.0,"inst_net_60":-4.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0694,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.0001,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0693,"frgn_net_120":-65422.0,"inst_net_120":-14604.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.8683,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.1938,"smart_net_120_pct":-1.0621,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":-11.0,"op_margin_q":-10.7843,"op_qoq":21.4286,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-10.0,"rev_yoy":32.4675,"op_trend_4q":-76.3636,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-14.17,"debt_ratio":185.65,"